#: whale/ai/whaleaidisclaimer.cpp:72
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"AI agents are powerful tools. They can modify files, execute commands, "
"install software, and change system settings. Mistakes can cause data loss "
"or damage your operating system."
msgstr ""

#: whale/ai/whaleaidisclaimer.cpp:74
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Please keep the following in mind:"
msgstr ""

#: whale/ai/whaleaidisclaimer.cpp:75
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info lead of a list item"
msgid "Start safely."
msgstr ""

#: whale/ai/whaleaidisclaimer.cpp:76
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If you are new to AI agents, experiment in a virtual machine first. You can "
"run Orcinus inside one."
msgstr ""

#: whale/ai/whaleaidisclaimer.cpp:77
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info lead of a list item"
msgid "Know the basics."
msgstr ""

#: whale/ai/whaleaidisclaimer.cpp:79
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Familiarity with Linux users, permissions, and file systems is strongly "
"recommended. Advanced system administration knowledge is helpful, but not "
"required."
msgstr ""

#: whale/ai/whaleaidisclaimer.cpp:81
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info lead of a list item"
msgid "Ask when unsure."
msgstr ""

#: whale/ai/whaleaidisclaimer.cpp:82
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If you do not understand an action or its consequences, ask the agent to "
"explain before proceeding."
msgstr ""

#: whale/ai/whaleaidisclaimer.cpp:83
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info lead of a list item"
msgid "Keep backups."
msgstr ""

#: whale/ai/whaleaidisclaimer.cpp:83
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Protect important files before giving agents access to your system."
msgstr ""

#: whale/ai/whaleaidisclaimer.cpp:84
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info lead of a list item"
msgid "No undo."
msgstr ""

#: whale/ai/whaleaidisclaimer.cpp:86
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"What an agent changes on your system bypasses Orcinus' Undo and Redo and "
"cannot be taken back there. Only the agent itself may offer a way to reverse "
"its changes."
msgstr ""

#: whale/ai/whaleaidisclaimer.cpp:88
#, kde-format
